WEBVTT

00:14:57.833 --> 00:15:01.601
in which you express
the willingness to be vulnerable,

00:15:01.625 --> 00:15:04.309
based on positive
expectations with others.

00:15:04.333 --> 00:15:05.601
Then there is a view

00:15:05.625 --> 00:15:08.476
that looks at trust as process
rather than state.

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:12.518
And it looks at trusting
processes like intentions,

00:15:12.542 --> 00:15:15.434
expectations, behaviors,
thoughts, et cetera.

00:15:15.458 --> 00:15:19.059
But in the end, there is no agreement.

00:15:19.083 --> 00:15:21.726
The most complex psychological experience,

00:15:21.750 --> 00:15:23.393
subjective experiences

00:15:23.417 --> 00:15:26.851
actually are very hard to define.

00:15:26.875 --> 00:15:29.018
So that said, you know,

00:15:29.042 --> 00:15:30.851
I continue to look at other things